[380.643151, "o", "\u001b[0m\u001b[?7h\u001b[0mKujo native tools discovered:- kujo_discover: kujo/DiscoverKujoAbilities — finds engineering Abilities including ShipCheck, PackWrite, Spec, Eval, Scout, Workcell, Loop- kujo_execute: kujo/ExecuteKujoAbility — runs a discovered Ability in an operator-trusted workspaceAvailable ability IDs depend on the plugin context and cannot be determined by discovery tool alone. Try these explicit paths when executing: kujo/DiscoverKujoAbilities, kujo/ExecuteKujoAbility.\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
